VALUES (218, 'tt0088247', NULL, 'The Terminator', 'The Terminator', 'movie', 1984, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvktm0BHcnmDpul4Hz01GIazWPr.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ffdqHMWkh1h9MABwIfbfRJhgFW6.jpg', 'In the post-apocalyptic future, reigning tyrannical supercomputers teleport a cyborg assassin known as the "Terminator" back to 1984 to kill Sarah Connor, whose unborn son is destined to lead insurgents against 21st century mechanical hegemony. Meanwhile, the human-resistance movement dispatches a lone warrior to safeguard Sarah. Can he stop the virtually indestructible killing machine?', NULL, NULL, 18.9122, 7.7, 0, 2.80325000000000024e+01, '2026-07-20 01:02:04', '2026-11-22 02:35:52')
