VALUES (11830, 'tt0092048', NULL, 'Tampopo', 'タンポポ', 'movie', 1985, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArYdSuX3zY9fMsE4LqmBl7xJq5R.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oq8HM9TOSbH54Xy0OBJGzYrtUC7.jpg', 'In this humorous paean to the joys of food, a pair of truck drivers happen onto a decrepit roadside shop selling ramen noodles. The widowed owner, Tampopo, begs them to help her turn her establishment into a paragon of the "art of noodle-soup making". Interspersed are satirical vignettes about the importance of food to different aspects of human life.', NULL, NULL, 3.4461, 7.803, 0, 1.64792307692307673e+01, '2026-07-20 04:02:06', '2026-11-22 02:35:52')
