VALUES (110379, 'tt0100732', NULL, 'Twilight', 'Szürkület', 'movie', 1990, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gwAZ38t4VXgafdq9hJfkE6BBBP.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2zIEXlkd8iH10vFIG4zhjxSngKR.jpg', 'In the dense and murky woodlands of provincial Hungary, the search for a child murderer drags a once-respected detective into an all-consuming obsession enshrouded by irresolution and despair, even long after he has been taken off the case. What emerges is not a crime story, but a harrowing venture through the darkness of the human soul.', NULL, NULL, 2.4331, 7.1, 0, 7.18, '2026-08-04 03:20:13', '2026-11-22 02:35:52')
